  "text": "A free password manager fills your logins automatically with zero tedious memorization required. Juggling dozens of complicated passwords across work accounts, portals, and subscriptions causes constant daily frustration. Manually typing passwords slows you down and tempts you into using dangerously short, predictable phrases. Install the Bitwarden or 1Password extension to detect login fields and autofill credentials with one click. You will never reset a forgotten password again.",
